# The fixtures in this directory are GENERATED by generate_perf_notes.py, which
# is the source of truth for them: it is tunable, and it reproduces them byte
# for byte. They come to about 1.2 MB of derivable text, so the script is
# tracked and its output is not.
#
# Run `python tests/data/perf/generate_perf_notes.py` to recreate them.
*.md

# ...except the documentation, which is written by hand.
!README.md
